<title>SPAIN: Details of Spanish government spending plans.</title>
<headline>Details of Spanish government spending plans.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish government provided the following spending details for its 1997 central government budget (figures in billions of pesetas unless stated).</p>
<p>					  1996	 1997	 Change</p>
<p>									(pct)</p>
<p>Personnel spending		 2,829	2,984	  1.9</p>
<p>    active			   2,158	2,196	  1.3</p>
<p>    passive			    751	  788	  3.5</p>
<p>    Goods and services	     336	  302	 -8.9</p>
<p>Financial costs		    3,389	3,459	  1.8</p>
<p>Current transfers		  9,360	9,714	  3.8</p>
<p>Real investment			979	  833	-15.0</p>
<p>Capital transfers		    787	  805	  2.3</p>
<p>TOTAL SPENDING BUDGET	   17,791     18,089	  1.7</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
